      "id": "github:1242815792",
      "name": "BeaconHS",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "BeaconHS 是面向工业建筑的多租户开源 HSE 平台，覆盖事件与未遂事件、调查、检查与危险评估、CAPA 验证关闭、培训、设备、许可和可配置表单；AGPL-3.0，自托管。公开社区核心提供完整平台功能，未见单独的付费企业版；company-specific migration tooling 为私有、未包含在公开 workspace。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/braedonsaunders/beaconhs",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/braedonsaunders/beaconhs",
      "github_repository_id": 1242815792,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/beaconhs/license",
      "sources": [
